			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140250102,
					"content": "人齊了，今天也按照計畫行動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250103,
						140250104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250103,
					"content": "稍等一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250105,
					"content": "什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲米尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250106,
					"content": "「僕人」跟「博士」合作過嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250107,
					"content": "為什麼這麼問？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250108,
					"content": "其實，我們昨天晚上見到了克雷薇，這是她告訴我們的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250109,
					"content": "我們在須彌見過「博士」。他不但很危險，而且做過很多壞事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250110,
					"content": "…我不敢保證「父親」與「博士」沒有來往，但我認為「父親」不會跟他合作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250111,
					"content": "我們並非同一派系，相互也不信任，沒有合作的基礎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250112,
					"content": "不過，我聽說「父親」剛剛成為執行官的時候，「博士」的確有提過想要跟壁爐之家合作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250113,
					"content": "「父親」拒絕了大部分提案，只保留了一個秘密實驗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250114,
					"content": "秘密實驗？克雷薇說的該不會就是這個吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250115,
					"content": "應該不是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250116,
					"content": "我不知道那個秘密實驗是什麼，但它是壁爐之家獨立完成的，「博士」只提供了研究方向，算不上是合作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250117,
					"content": "而且只是實驗內容保密而已，參與實驗的人都有完整紀錄，跟克雷薇說的情況也對不上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250118,
					"content": "#請相信我們。壁爐之家隸屬於愚人眾，難免會做一些{F#妳}{M#你}們無法接受的事情。但我們有自己的規矩，有自己的底線。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250119,
					"content": "呼。那我們就放心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250120,
					"content": "說實話，如果「僕人」真的和「博士」合作過，做了一些很過分的事情，我也不知道該怎麼面對你們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250121,
					"content": "可是，難道克雷薇在說謊嗎？總覺得也不太像…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250122,
					"content": "要是能直接問問「僕人」就好了，但她應該不會輕易告訴我們的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250123,
					"content": "先開始今天的計畫吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250124,
					"content": "#「父親」昨天沒有回來，應該還在海岸附近，拜託{F#妳}{M#你}們了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250125,
					"content": "琳妮特，妳跟我走。菲米尼，你也要小心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250126,
					"content": "開始行動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "林尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250104,
					"content": "我有個問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250105
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
