				{
					"id": 140250301,
					"content": "離接下來的談判還有點時間，我們就在這聊聊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250302,
					"content": "#很高興見到{F#妳}{M#你}們和我家的孩子相處融洽。孩子想要成長，良好的人際關係是必不可少的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250303,
					"content": "「僕人」…妳會怎麼處置他們？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250304,
					"content": "林尼、琳妮特、菲米尼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250305,
					"content": "還有菲約爾、南特伊…人還真不少。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250306,
					"content": "我向來對背叛者一視同仁，沒有任何特例。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250307,
					"content": "妳…妳會「殺死」他們嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250308,
					"content": "想為他們求情嗎？很遺憾，沒有人能改變家的規矩。在這裡，所有人都要為自己的言行舉止負責。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250309,
					"content": "妳、妳對他們沒有任何感情嗎？他們一直叫妳「父親」，而且發自內心地尊敬妳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250310,
					"content": "任何一個組織，若是人情大於規矩，就會迅速走向衰敗。更何況是以嚴格著稱的壁爐之家呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250311,
					"content": "#唯一能安慰{F#妳}{M#你}們的是：作為客人，{F#妳}{M#你}們並不在清算範圍之內。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250312,
					"content": "沒有別的解決辦法嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250313,
					"content": "林尼他們大概能保住性命。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250314,
					"content": "菲約爾、南特伊為首的這些人，再加上克雷薇…他們想要叛逃，那就沒有商量的餘地了，沒有人能帶著秘密活著離開。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250315,
					"content": "這…未免太殘酷了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250316,
					"content": "這樣如何，看在客人的份上，我再多等一段時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250317,
					"content": "如果在這期間，林尼他們成功讓克雷薇消失，那就銷毀了證據，我不會再追究他們的過錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250318,
					"content": "否則，我會抓住正在幹壞事的他們，讓所有人受到嚴酷的懲罰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250319,
						140250320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250319,
					"content": "一言為定。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250321
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250321,
					"content": "#放心。還有，這個{F#妳}{M#你}們收好，不要再搞丟了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250322,
					"content": "訓練一隻魔術飛鳥要花不少時間，死了有些可惜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250323,
					"content": "妳、妳從哪抓到的——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250324,
					"content": "好了。閒聊到此結束，該做正事了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250325,
					"content": "#之所以約{F#妳}{M#你}們在這裡見面，是因為我要去沫芒宮談一件事情。跟{F#妳}{M#你}們無關，但請{F#妳}{M#你}們跟在我身邊，不要想回去通風報信。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250326,
					"content": "走吧，時間剛剛好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250320,
					"content": "不許反悔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250321
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1402504,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1402504
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
