				{
					"id": 140250502,
					"content": "又是湖泊又是河流的，難道說…你們在討論什麼跟水有關的工程嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250503,
					"content": "兩位很好奇嗎？現在似乎並不是關心這個的時候。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250504,
					"content": "也是…不知道林尼那邊怎麼樣了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250505,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}在想辦法嗎？加油啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250506,
					"content": "（「僕人」看起來很輕鬆，但她身上的殺意不是裝出來的。她似乎真的想殺死那些涉嫌「背叛」的孩子們。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250507,
					"content": "（該怎麼做才能阻止她？不，在那之前，還有另一個問題。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250508
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250508,
					"content": "（在沫芒宮門口，她提到了克雷薇的名字。這是否意味著她早就掌握了克雷薇的行蹤？林尼他們的行動在「僕人」的預料內嗎？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250509
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250509,
					"content": "哇——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250510,
					"content": "#疼疼…等一下，{F#妳}{M#你}沒事吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250511,
					"content": "都怪我，光想著賣報的事情，沒看前面的路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250512,
						140250513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250512,
					"content": "抱歉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250514
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250514,
					"content": "#啊，作為補償，這份報紙{F#妳}{M#你}們收下吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250515,
					"content": "（這個人…總覺得有點眼熟？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250516,
					"content": "不用啦，這多不好意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250517,
					"content": "沒關係，反正我手上還有不少。報紙這東西，拖到明天送都送不出去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250518,
					"content": "都怪我，想著多賺點錢補貼家用，一口氣進了太多貨。結果今天看報紙的人少，現在還沒賣完呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250519,
					"content": "在聊什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250520,
					"content": "沒什麼沒什麼，剛剛不小心撞到了這位朋友，我現在就走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250521,
					"content": "等一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250522,
					"content": "這個…如果索要賠償的話，我沒有現金…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250523,
					"content": "拿三份報紙，這是摩拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250524,
					"content": "啊？謝謝惠顧，神明保佑您發大財！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250525,
					"content": "要是每天都能遇到像您這樣慷慨的人就好了…開玩笑的，明天我還是少進點報紙，不能因為快結婚了就心急。再見各位！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧爾內"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250526,
					"content": "事情辦完了，坐船回白淞鎮吧，路上還可以看報紙打發時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250527,
					"content": "等、等一下…再逛一下怎麼樣？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250528,
					"content": "對了，我肚子餓了——必須要吃飽了才能回去！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250529,
					"content": "（派蒙在努力尋找不回去的理由。時間還早，林尼那邊幾乎不可能有什麼進展。現在該怎麼辦…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250530
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250530,
					"content": "#看來{F#妳}{M#你}們似乎還懷有一些美好的幻想，認為再拖一段時間，情況或許會出現轉機。在我看來這種掙扎毫無意義。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250531,
					"content": "#不過，如果{F#妳}{M#你}們願意答應我一個條件，我可以再多給林尼一點時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250532,
					"content": "#另外，我也會解答{F#妳}{M#你}們心裡的疑惑。比如克雷薇到底是誰，跟我是什麼關係…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250533,
					"content": "妳、妳怎麼突然這麼大方了，不會是要我們做什麼壞事吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250534,
					"content": "#不要太高估自己，{F#妳}{M#你}們並沒有做壞事的天分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250535,
					"content": "唔…那妳為什麼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250536
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250536,
					"content": "交涉最重要的是利益互換，一味地索取或威脅得不到想要的結果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250537
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250537,
					"content": "我們可以聽聽妳的條件。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250538
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250538,
					"content": "很好。我的條件是——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250539
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250539,
					"content": "#「在必要的時候，做出{F#妳}{M#你}們認為最適合的選擇，幫一次壁爐之家。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250540
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250540,
					"content": "奇怪，怎麼感覺很正常…不過「必要的時候」，指的是什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250541
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250541,
					"content": "#這個就交給{F#妳}{M#你}們判斷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250542
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250542,
					"content": "可以答應妳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250543
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140250543,
					"content": "交涉成立。跟我來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 140250513,
					"content": "我也沒注意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140250514
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
